710284281272825072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AfE0CnBR9aUQ7kNvwHdxnmZ&_nc_oc=AdoLZR2AaMTcdTZfIzA4Pw6q282iBQyZgf2grvWuCHN3j1wCWfaUQWafro9kE9T-rns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLyDsK9E_b99eNUxOXxIKwpSE1QnPenJfDXkbTnHq3xA&oe=6B086791"}, {"file_name": "screen5.png", "id": "26929360613363524", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_26929360623363523_2113377200488000399_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gtu3qUmSIHwQ7kNvwHRwwv8&_nc_oc=Adoi6s7exmANlJ6J0lFxZmKEptoVtWBGb2uRzVUCtl-FVuuyLlbXdqHAHs84hKwRRHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWbhQ4AG_vngTTY8go4rsUIObmrpWY1fsJ5JbYKGKlOQ&oe=6B085562"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Place To Pray", "keywords": ["church", "pray", "praying", "Bible", "Meditation"], "long_description": "Escape the noise of the world and enter a space of total tranquility. Our realistic graphics capture the light, scale, and atmosphere of a grand cathedral, making it the perfect setting for your spiritual journey.\n\nDiscover a new way to connect with your faith. Play for pray : invites you into a masterfully crafted, high-fidelity church environment designed to provide a peaceful sanctuary for prayer and study. this experience combines stunning architectural realism with the power of immersive technology.\n\nThe Full Holy Bible: Engage with the Word of God in a natural, readable format directly within the VR environment.\n\nUse the app as a personal \"play for praying,\" allowing for focused devotion without outside distractions.", "short_description": "Step into a breathtakingly realistic cathedral designed for prayer, peace, and reflection. Experience the Holy Bible in a fully immersive environment, complete with celestial visual effects and a serene atmosphere. Whether for daily devotion or quiet meditation."}]}, "deve